WEBVTT

00:16.141 --> 00:19.561
CLEANING DUTY
AHN SU-HO, YEON SI-EUN, OH BEOM-SEOK

00:19.644 --> 00:21.312
Our science teacher is nuts.

00:22.897 --> 00:24.816
His voice is like a sleeping pill.

00:24.899 --> 00:26.860
Hell, I was falling asleep.

00:29.904 --> 00:31.656
While he was talking,

00:31.740 --> 00:34.242
I was thinking
Si-eun could teach it better.

00:34.325 --> 00:35.160
No way.

00:35.744 --> 00:37.370
He's not much of a talker.

00:38.621 --> 00:39.831
I doubt it.

00:39.914 --> 00:43.001
Is there any subject you find interesting?

00:43.501 --> 00:44.878
You're always sleeping.

00:46.212 --> 00:47.255
What do you know?

00:47.756 --> 00:50.759
You always have your eyes to the front
and a pen behind your ear.

00:50.842 --> 00:51.760
Whatever.

00:52.969 --> 00:54.929
I'm hungry. Let's go eat.

00:55.013 --> 00:56.306
I need to go to work.

00:56.389 --> 00:57.640
Filling in for Yeong-i.

00:57.724 --> 00:58.767
See you tomorrow.

01:00.602 --> 01:01.603
I have to go too.

01:02.103 --> 01:03.813
I have stuff to do at home.

01:03.897 --> 01:05.648
Let's all eat together tomorrow.

01:06.274 --> 01:07.233
I'm off.

01:39.599 --> 01:41.226
Do you understand the situation?

01:42.185 --> 01:43.019
Yes.

01:43.770 --> 01:45.105
Send someone quickly.

01:59.410 --> 02:02.664
Detectives will arrive soon.
Just do as you're told. Okay?

02:03.164 --> 02:04.165
Okay.

02:09.754 --> 02:10.588
Okay.

02:13.174 --> 02:14.175
What's the story?

02:17.011 --> 02:18.012
So…

02:18.930 --> 02:20.306
We were working out.

02:21.141 --> 02:23.935
He took a break by himself
and suddenly passed out.

02:26.271 --> 02:27.147
What else?

02:29.023 --> 02:31.901
We have to make sure
the other kids won't talk about this.

02:32.443 --> 02:35.446
If it goes wrong,
we're all going to juvie.

02:36.990 --> 02:38.408
Have you deleted the videos?

02:39.534 --> 02:40.535
Yes.

02:40.618 --> 02:41.870
Let's check the CCTV.

03:27.081 --> 03:28.082
WHERE ARE YOU?

03:28.166 --> 03:30.835
I'M WORKING OUT. I'LL CALL YOU LATER.

04:16.923 --> 04:22.053
WEAK HERO:
CLASS 1

05:18.568 --> 05:20.111
Piece of shit.

05:20.903 --> 05:23.364
Fucker, how do you live with yourself?

05:28.328 --> 05:32.248
I'll have you killed
the second you land in the Philippines.

05:41.591 --> 05:42.759
How's Su-ho?

05:44.344 --> 05:47.013
Son of a bitch. Are you serious?

05:49.223 --> 05:50.350
Hey.

05:50.433 --> 05:54.020
Watch him 24/7 until he's on that plane.

05:54.103 --> 05:55.313
Is that understood?

05:55.396 --> 05:56.522
Absolutely, sir.

05:56.606 --> 05:57.648
Shit!

05:57.732 --> 05:59.317
You son of a bitch.

06:10.203 --> 06:14.749
COLLEGE MATRICULATION

06:49.117 --> 06:50.993
I called the police.

06:51.077 --> 06:52.829
And I'll keep looking.

06:53.663 --> 06:55.873
Go home. You have exams tomorrow.

07:07.760 --> 07:11.973
I'M WORKING OUT. I'LL CALL YOU LATER.

07:16.144 --> 07:17.603
Don't think about cheating.

07:17.687 --> 07:20.106
Just do your best
with what you've studied, okay?

07:20.606 --> 07:21.941
Yes.

07:44.213 --> 07:47.508
I messed up my test,
so don't brag about your score.

07:50.094 --> 07:52.138
- I'll end up at night school.
- Phones!

07:53.306 --> 07:54.599
Come get your phones.

08:09.405 --> 08:15.995
YEONG-I
MISSED CALL

08:24.212 --> 08:25.046
Si-eun.

08:25.796 --> 08:26.631
Yeong-i.

08:27.423 --> 08:28.341
Did you call?

08:30.718 --> 08:31.969
Poor Su-ho.

08:34.430 --> 08:35.932
How could this happen?

08:46.025 --> 08:47.652
Beom-seok is fucking crazy.

08:48.194 --> 08:49.570
Those bastards did it.

08:50.446 --> 08:53.658
Some people came by
and offered to pay the hospital bills.

08:54.158 --> 08:56.619
They had his grandma sign a contract.

09:15.888 --> 09:16.931
Si-eun.

09:22.478 --> 09:23.980
Su-ho is…

09:31.696 --> 09:33.823
Su-ho… won't wake up.

09:55.011 --> 09:56.762
You're Su-ho's friend?

10:00.933 --> 10:01.767
Yes.

10:06.272 --> 10:07.857
You must be Si-eun.

11:18.886 --> 11:20.388
Go back to school.

11:22.014 --> 11:23.432
You have tests to take.

11:27.269 --> 11:29.355
I'll stay, so you can go.

11:35.903 --> 11:36.779
Get some rest.

12:31.083 --> 12:31.917
Take a shower.

12:35.504 --> 12:37.631
You'll stop by the school
with your father.

12:38.549 --> 12:40.426
To say goodbye to your teachers.

12:59.195 --> 13:00.154
Hey.

13:03.115 --> 13:04.200
What about Su-ho?

13:07.912 --> 13:08.996
He's still alive.

13:12.666 --> 13:14.543
If you want to keep him alive,

13:14.627 --> 13:16.504
you'd better do as your father said.

13:24.720 --> 13:27.640
In the survey,
48.7% of the respondents said

13:27.723 --> 13:29.600
they didn't get enough sleep.

13:30.100 --> 13:31.977
The reasons given

13:32.061 --> 13:35.064
were private classes, tutoring,
homework, and online classes,

13:35.147 --> 13:37.733
showing that students spend
too much time studying.

13:37.817 --> 13:41.237
JISEONG HIGH SCHOOL

14:03.968 --> 14:05.386
The door was all broken…

14:08.264 --> 14:09.974
Which class is Jeon Yeong-bin in?

14:30.202 --> 14:31.078
What is it?

14:49.805 --> 14:51.140
Where is that bastard?

14:54.226 --> 14:55.060
Who?

15:13.120 --> 15:14.371
The athlete.

15:15.706 --> 15:17.541
- Your friend.
- In the gym.

15:18.667 --> 15:19.919
Probably in the gym.

15:21.045 --> 15:22.212
He's the one, right?

15:23.797 --> 15:24.632
What?

15:26.800 --> 15:27.927
Did he do it?

15:28.552 --> 15:30.179
I wasn't there. I swear.

15:32.306 --> 15:33.933
I've only seen the video they sent.

15:35.935 --> 15:36.852
What video?

15:40.731 --> 15:42.024
Answer me.

15:46.028 --> 15:47.821
I had nothing to do with it.

15:48.948 --> 15:49.907
Oh Beom-seok.

15:50.741 --> 15:52.451
He did this shit himself.

16:01.794 --> 16:02.836
I don't care.

16:17.184 --> 16:20.145
Fuck you. Keep my name out of your mouth.

16:23.232 --> 16:25.025
Fucking bastard.

16:32.866 --> 16:34.076
Shit.

16:36.829 --> 16:37.830
What is it?

16:42.835 --> 16:44.878
You did this to Su-ho, didn't you?

16:48.173 --> 16:50.676
I knew it. Get the fuck out of the car!

16:50.759 --> 16:52.386
Get out! Fucking bastard!

16:52.469 --> 16:55.431
Who do you think you are,
fucking up the boys' lives like that?

16:55.514 --> 16:57.933
What the fuck did Su-ho do
to deserve this?

16:58.017 --> 16:58.934
Fucking coward!

16:59.018 --> 17:01.270
- Aren't you sorry?
- Worthless trash.

17:01.353 --> 17:03.397
Come out, you fucking asshole!

17:03.480 --> 17:05.816
Beg for fucking forgiveness!

17:05.899 --> 17:07.568
Come out, you son of a bitch!

17:09.153 --> 17:10.362
Fucking coward.

17:17.327 --> 17:20.748
This all got fucked up
because you got between us.

17:23.876 --> 17:26.128
We got on so well before you came along.

17:28.547 --> 17:29.590
Hey!

17:30.340 --> 17:31.717
What are you doing?

17:32.760 --> 17:33.635
Let's go.

17:34.428 --> 17:36.013
- Fuck.
- Deal with her.

17:58.452 --> 18:00.746
JISEONG HIGH SCHOOL
WEIGHT ROOM

18:33.779 --> 18:34.780
Hey.

18:34.863 --> 18:36.573
I can see your petty tricks.

18:39.660 --> 18:41.662
Your arms must always protect your chin.

18:41.745 --> 18:44.331
Remember. Your chin.

18:48.877 --> 18:49.962
What?

18:50.045 --> 18:51.255
You want to fight?

18:52.798 --> 18:54.591
Let's say you're facing some punk.

18:54.675 --> 18:57.386
If that happens,
don't look them in the eyes.

18:57.469 --> 18:58.554
Watch the shoulders.

19:00.514 --> 19:02.975
When the shoulder is coming at you…

19:12.985 --> 19:15.529
I told you
I could see all your petty tricks.

19:21.285 --> 19:22.452
You

19:22.536 --> 19:23.370
can't

19:23.453 --> 19:25.497
fucking beat me.

19:30.502 --> 19:32.921
And then you just… you fucking just…

19:34.047 --> 19:34.965
Run.

19:36.383 --> 19:37.551
Don't look back.

19:39.970 --> 19:41.638
Don't fight and get hurt.

19:44.308 --> 19:45.434
No way.

19:49.521 --> 19:50.355
What?

20:22.095 --> 20:23.430
You fucker!

20:43.242 --> 20:44.952
Wait a minute.

20:46.286 --> 20:47.371
Ahn Su-ho.

20:48.038 --> 20:51.083
It was because
Beom-seok kept kicking his head.

20:51.667 --> 20:53.794
I had nothing to fucking do with it!

20:55.587 --> 20:56.421
Is that so?

20:57.214 --> 20:58.048
- I got it.
- No!

20:58.131 --> 21:00.759
Fuck, we were just sparring!

21:01.677 --> 21:03.136
Please, let's stop this.

21:03.679 --> 21:05.764
I'm sorry. Yeah?

21:08.600 --> 21:10.269
Don't apologize to me.

21:26.410 --> 21:31.415
SCHOOL WHERE THE STUDENTS
AND THE TEACHERS ARE HAPPY

21:59.609 --> 22:00.777
You were waiting?

22:00.861 --> 22:05.032
Thank you for taking your precious time
to visit us, sir.

22:05.115 --> 22:07.492
It's no problem.
I should have come sooner.

22:07.576 --> 22:09.077
I was just so busy.

22:09.161 --> 22:10.579
- These are our teachers.
- I see.

22:10.662 --> 22:12.039
Was it a few days ago?

22:13.248 --> 22:16.752
I heard one of the students here
was badly injured.

22:18.337 --> 22:19.379
Yes.

22:20.881 --> 22:24.676
Apparently, he was training at the gym
with his friends.

22:24.760 --> 22:27.429
He took a break by himself,

22:27.929 --> 22:30.098
and he suddenly passed out.

22:32.059 --> 22:33.560
It was an accident.

22:34.269 --> 22:35.520
Oh dear. Is that so?

23:51.555 --> 23:52.848
What is it, Si-eun?

23:54.641 --> 23:56.184
What happened to your uniform?

23:59.771 --> 24:00.689
Si-eun.

24:01.440 --> 24:02.816
What's all that blood?

24:07.946 --> 24:08.905
Fuck!

24:10.824 --> 24:12.742
Oh shit. Hey!

24:12.826 --> 24:15.370
Hey. Just calm down, okay?

24:15.871 --> 24:18.206
Let's just talk. Fuck! We can talk!

24:21.668 --> 24:22.794
What the fuck?

24:29.968 --> 24:30.802
Stay back!

24:31.720 --> 24:32.596
Stay back!

24:33.263 --> 24:34.389
Go away!

24:34.473 --> 24:35.932
Oh fuck!

24:51.114 --> 24:51.990
You bastard!

24:52.073 --> 24:53.200
Fuck!

25:40.622 --> 25:41.748
I asked you not to.

25:45.335 --> 25:46.294
I said stop.

25:47.671 --> 25:48.672
Just hit me.

25:54.052 --> 25:55.262
We were friends.

26:00.016 --> 26:01.101
I said do it.

26:17.242 --> 26:18.118
Fuck.

26:20.203 --> 26:21.037
Why?

26:22.414 --> 26:23.415
Why did you do it?

26:28.920 --> 26:31.339
I don't really know.

26:41.349 --> 26:44.060
You should understand me, Si-eun.

26:49.149 --> 26:49.983
Yeah.

26:51.234 --> 26:52.110
I understand.

26:54.946 --> 26:55.989
So you should…

26:58.575 --> 26:59.784
also understand me.

27:41.534 --> 27:44.037
Why are you all out here?

27:46.331 --> 27:47.832
What's with him?

27:47.916 --> 27:48.917
Get him to stop.

27:49.000 --> 27:50.377
- Yeon Si-eun!
- Go stop him.

27:50.460 --> 27:51.795
Hey, Yeon Si-eun!

27:51.878 --> 27:53.046
Si-eun, come here.

27:53.129 --> 27:54.589
- Si-eun!
- Hey!

27:56.091 --> 27:57.634
- Si-eun!
- Yeon Si-eun!

27:59.135 --> 28:00.053
Yeon Si-eun!

28:03.348 --> 28:05.141
What the fuck do you want?

30:00.965 --> 30:01.883
Si-eun.

30:02.592 --> 30:03.802
Taking a nap? Seriously?

30:23.112 --> 30:23.947
Yeah.

30:25.907 --> 30:26.741
I was sleepy.

30:32.455 --> 30:33.915
You really are

30:35.583 --> 30:37.168
a total lunatic.

30:37.919 --> 30:38.920
You know that?

30:43.633 --> 30:44.467
I'm sorry.

30:46.761 --> 30:47.595
What for?

30:51.724 --> 30:52.642
For everything.

31:00.191 --> 31:01.150
Me too.

31:06.197 --> 31:07.073
I'm sorry.

33:09.070 --> 33:10.196
As for Beom-seok…

33:17.203 --> 33:18.955
I heard he went to study abroad.

33:30.800 --> 33:32.552
Yeong-i said it was her fault.

33:34.262 --> 33:36.305
She apologized before she left.

33:38.349 --> 33:41.185
I heard she checks up
on Su-ho's grandmother.

33:42.562 --> 33:44.188
But I can't reach her.

33:48.985 --> 33:52.238
Beom-seok's father tried
to send me to juvie

33:53.281 --> 33:56.617
but said I could transfer schools instead
as long as I kept quiet.

34:01.414 --> 34:03.499
But thanks to his power,

34:03.583 --> 34:06.085
none of the schools
in Seoul would take me.

34:06.586 --> 34:10.089
But then Eunjang High School
in Yeongdeungpo accepted me.

34:16.095 --> 34:18.723
EUNJANG HIGH SCHOOL

34:36.532 --> 34:37.366
Si-eun.

34:40.620 --> 34:41.954
I said we'd come with you.

34:42.455 --> 34:44.540
I want to meet your teacher.

34:46.459 --> 34:47.293
It's fine.

34:48.002 --> 34:48.920
I'll go alone.

34:56.344 --> 34:57.470
You did the right thing.

35:05.144 --> 35:06.521
You did nothing wrong.

35:16.280 --> 35:17.782
Be quiet!

35:17.865 --> 35:18.699
Go on, fight!

35:23.371 --> 35:24.205
That's it!

35:24.705 --> 35:25.540
Hey!

35:27.959 --> 35:30.086
- I said hit him!
- Hey!

35:34.298 --> 35:35.424
To your seats now.

35:35.508 --> 35:36.801
Go on. Sit down.

35:37.802 --> 35:38.845
Sit down!

35:40.513 --> 35:42.849
Hey! Can't you see I'm here?

35:49.147 --> 35:50.481
He's a transfer student.

35:52.191 --> 35:53.067
Say hello.

35:56.320 --> 35:57.321
I'm Yeon Si-eun.

35:58.197 --> 35:59.073
Nice to meet you.

36:03.161 --> 36:05.121
Si-eun. Sit over there.

36:24.307 --> 36:25.183
Hi.

36:39.906 --> 36:40.865
Yeon Si-eun?

36:41.490 --> 36:42.658
It's a pretty name.

36:43.409 --> 36:44.243
What?

36:44.327 --> 36:45.244
Are you a girl?

36:50.708 --> 36:52.251
What's that look, bitch?

36:52.752 --> 36:55.630
It makes me feel fucking offended.
Fuck, it's like…

36:56.130 --> 36:57.840
It's giving me a chill.

36:59.884 --> 37:00.885
God, it's cold!

37:06.599 --> 37:07.850
You're our slave now.

37:10.770 --> 37:11.896
How come you guys

37:13.689 --> 37:15.566
are always so predictable?

37:17.485 --> 37:18.319
What?

37:22.448 --> 37:23.532
Do you do this…

37:25.826 --> 37:26.744
for your ego?

37:28.496 --> 37:30.373
What did you say, asshole?

37:31.666 --> 37:33.501
Should I rip out your tongue?

38:09.954 --> 38:12.081
This is the new student at Eunjang.

38:12.873 --> 38:15.209
He beat Kang Woo-yeong, a Union candidate.

38:19.630 --> 38:20.715
What should we do?

42:12.154 --> 42:15.157
ALL NAMES, PLACES, AND EVENTS SHOWN
ARE FICTIONAL

42:15.241 --> 42:17.743
ANY SIMILARITY TO REALITY IS COINCIDENTAL

42:19.578 --> 42:22.790
Subtitle translation by: James Webb
